MODULE: InboundNotAccounted
TARGET: AccountingCorrect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: inbound apply bypasses accounting as well as admission
PERTURBS: ApplyReplication

--- FIND
    /\ live' = [live EXCEPT ![r] = @ + 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<scope, band, age, phase, sample, published, slots, decision>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ live' = live
    /\ UNCHANGED <<scope, band, age, phase, sample, published, slots, decision>>
--- END
